	<key>This deletes every slot value, the journal of edits, the context documents, the translation memory and the saved run positions — the app-side session, for every project at once.

It stays: the project list, and every .xcstrings file. A catalog keeps the strings and the translations already written into it.

What a re-scan cannot rebuild: the context documents and the translation memory are what the app LEARNED from your corrections, and this deletes them. Edits a window is still holding — anything not yet written to a file — go with the session.

Open catalogs re-read their files afterwards and read as untranslated work. The rows go in ONE pass, so even a large store is emptied in a second or two.</key>
	<string>Dan iħassar kull valur tas-slots, il-ġurnal tal-edits, id-dokumenti tal-kuntest, il-memorja tat-traduzzjoni u l-pożizzjonijiet tar-run issejvjati — is-sessjoni tal-app, għal kull proġett f’daqqa.

Jibqa’: il-lista tal-proġetti, u kull fajl .xcstrings. Katalogu jżomm l-istringi u t-traduzzjonijiet diġà miktuba fih.

X’rescans ma jistax jibni mill-ġdid: id-dokumenti tal-kuntest u l-memorja tat-traduzzjoni huma dak li l-app TGĦALLMET mill-korrezzjonijiet tiegħek, u dan iħassarhom. Edits li tieqa għadha qed iżżomm — kull ma għadu ma nkitebx f’fajl — imorru mas-sessjoni.

Katalogi miftuħa jerġgħu jaqraw il-fajls tagħhom wara u jinqraw bħala xogħol mhux tradott. Ir-ringieli jidħlu f’pass UNIKU, għalhekk anke store kbir jitbattal f’sekonda jew tnejn.</string>
